# Notes:
# - asset/dist/ is NOT tracked (it was through 3.26.x). Production installs the
#   release zip, which carries vendor/ and the bundle built from the tag, so
#   the server still needs no Node toolchain. A checkout deployed by hand
#   needs `npm ci && npm run build` (and `composer install --no-dev`) first.
